# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 (a building `match` adds no path segment), ch. 8 (`<-` binds the child's result by a tuple pattern; a widget application is transparent) and ruling TC (places counted as built: the loud arm builds place 0, so the button is 1 and the label 2; the soft arm builds none, so they are 0 and 1).
test loud

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="x")
    1: Ui.Button(label="go")
    2: Ui.Label(text="n 10, gone 0")

tick 1
  in:
    1: click
  changed:
    2: Ui.Label(text="n 10, gone 10")

